  ${YELLOW}MANUAL STEPS REQUIRED${RESET} - ChatDash API is blocked on current plan:

  1. Go to ${BOLD}https://chat-dash.com${RESET} -> Create Agent
     - Name: CNKB-${centreName}
     - Platform: Retell
     - Note the agent ID

  2. Go to Clients -> Create Client
     - Name: Code Ninjas ${centreName}
     - Member name: ${ownerName || "<owner_name>"}
     - Login ID: ${loginId}
     - Email: ${email}
