     - Name: Code Ninjas ${centreName}
     - Member name: ${ownerName || "<owner_name>"}
     - Login ID: ${loginId}
     - Email: ${email}
     - Password: ${password}

  3. Assign agent to client

  4. ChatDash auto-sets the Retell webhook when you connect the agent.
     Verify by checking: GET ${RETELL_BASE}/get-agent/${state.retellAgentId}
     The webhook_url should contain: api.chat-dash.com/v1/private/agents/{ID}/import/webhook

  5. Set forwarding URL in ChatDash agent settings:
     ${N8N_WEBHOOK}

  ${BOLD}TIP:${RESET} To discover the ChatDash agent ID programmatically, read the Retell
