<p>The setup depends on what type of email account receives your Lineleader notifications. <strong>Pick the option that matches your situation:</strong></p>

<!-- OPTION A: GMAIL -->
<div style="background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0;">
