<h2 style="color: #1a73e8; font-size: 20px;">2. Knowledge Base Setup</h2>

<p>Your AI agent uses a "knowledge base" document to answer questions about your centre — things like programs, pricing, age requirements, hours, and policies. The agent <strong>only</strong> shares information from this document. It won't guess or make things up, so the more complete and accurate it is, the better your calls will sound.</p>

