<li>Under <strong>"Add a condition"</strong>, select <strong>"From"</strong></li>
<li>Type: ${code("noreply@lineleader.com")} and press Enter</li>
<li>Click <strong>"Add another condition"</strong></li>
<li>Select <strong>"Subject includes"</strong></li>
