<li>Select <strong>"Automated cloud flow"</strong></li>
<li>Name it: <strong>CRM Lead Forwarding</strong></li>
<li>In the search box, search for: <strong>"When a new email arrives in a shared mailbox (V2)"</strong></li>
<li>Select it and click <strong>"Create"</strong></li>
</ol>

<h4>Step 3: Configure the Trigger</h4>
<ol>
